index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..e11a542dc505b9ab53546b6feecd0f3c1c622bc9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.web-templates/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
+# Web release templates
+
+These templates use Godot **4.7.1-stable**, commit
+`a13da4feb8d8aefc283c3763d33a2f170a18d541`, Emscripten **4.0.20**, and SCons
+**4.10.1**. Export with Godot 4.7.1 to match their resource formats.
+
+`custom.py` retains the game's 2D UI, GDScript, regular expressions, fonts,
+image decoders, MP3 audio, encrypted saves and legacy APIs required by Dialogic. `build-profile.json` removes
+unused engine classes. Full link-time optimization and `size_extra` produce
+ordinary raw WebAssembly below **20,000,000 bytes** in both variants.
+There is no gzip, Brotli or runtime decompression wrapper.
+
+| Variant | Raw WASM bytes |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Standard | 17,475,144 |
+| Threaded | 17,639,624 |
+
+The fallback text server supports the game's English, Russian, Portuguese,
+Turkish and Spanish text. It omits advanced ligature shaping and bidirectional
+layout; adding languages requiring those features requires a different template.
+`text-server-fallback.patch` makes unsupported Unicode variation selectors
+invisible while preserving character offsets, avoiding boxes after dialogue hearts.
+
+`0005-small-web-engine.patch` installs this hidden `.web-templates/` directory
+directly into the recovered project and selects these engines for both export presets. Godot excludes hidden directories from the pack.
+Normal game builds need no compiler and reject WASM files at or above 20 MB.
+
+To reproduce, install the versions above and activate Emscripten. From the
+Godot source checkout, substitute this repository's absolute path below:
+
+```sh
+cp /path/to/stalin-yuri-web/work/project/.web-templates/custom.py custom.py
+git apply /path/to/stalin-yuri-web/work/project/.web-templates/text-server-fallback.patch
+scons -j8 target=template_release threads=no optimize=size_extra build_profile=/path/to/stalin-yuri-web/work/project/.web-templates/build-profile.json
+scons -j8 target=template_release threads=yes optimize=size_extra build_profile=/path/to/stalin-yuri-web/work/project/.web-templates/build-profile.json
+```
+
+Copy `bin/godot.web.template_release.wasm32.nothreads.zip` to
+`work/project/.web-templates/web_nothreads_release.zip` and
+`bin/godot.web.template_release.wasm32.zip` to `work/project/.web-templates/web_release.zip`.
+
+Godot's license and third-party notices accompany the templates and exported builds.
